    "titleText": {
      "es": "100 años después, esta historia sigue siendo aterradora. No porque el asesino esté en la red local, sino porque sigue usando IPv4.",
      "en": "100 years later, this story remains terrifying--not because it's the local network block, but because the killer is still on IPv4.",
      "noteEn": "Both title attributes are preserved exactly, including the official double hyphen. OCR omitted the accent in AVERIGUÓ, fused the complete 192.168/16 network prefix into three identical boxes, and misread the initial inverted exclamation mark before GLUPS as a dotted capital I."
